-- TreeSpreadData: the trees thinned out of WorldPlan.Trees() (WORLD-SPREAD, T356):
-- movable wild trees in 100 stud cells holding more than 14 trees, and movable
-- trees whose trunk meets a rock, a scenery piece or a fixed tree, dropped by
-- TreeSpread.PlanSkip. Each entry keeps the tree's index and ground position
-- so a spec can check the list against the plan and MapBuilder can skip the
-- tree where it plants. Generated by `lune run tools/tree_report --skip`;
-- tests/TreeSpreadThin.spec.luau fails when this list is out of date.

